aq:[{q:"How many people do the cottages sleep?",a:"Elimäki sleeps 12, Meritähti and Merenneito 8, Pöytäkallio and Fransula 6, and Meripoika 5."},{q:"What is included in the price?",a:"A boat and firewood. Bed linen is €12.50 per person and final cleaning is €65–95."},{q:"What are the check-in and check-out times?",a:"Weekly stays change over on Saturdays. The cottage is yours from 4 pm on arrival day until noon on departure day. Weekend stays end at 3 pm on Sunday."},{q:"Can I rent the smoke sauna on its own?",a:"Yes. The smoke sauna by the pond takes up to 10 people and costs €160 per time. You can add the island grill shelter and crayfishing."},{q:"Where are the cottages?",a:"In Yläne, Pöytyä, around Lake Elijärvi, about 12 km from Yläne village and 65 km from Turku, Finland. Fransula is on the Säkylä side, on Koivulantie."},{q:"Do the cottages suit company events?",a:"Yes. They suit company meetings and recreation days, and the smoke sauna, grill shelter and a crayfish party can be booked for the same day."},{q:"How do I book?",a:"Call +358 400 534 973 or email mikameri@netti.fi with the cottage, your dates and the number of guests."}],cottage:{included:"What the cottage has",prices:"Weekly prices",weekendRow:"Weekend outside peak weeks",extras:"Extras for this cottage",where:"Location",onHuts:"The cottage on Huts.fi",others:"Our other cottages",bestFor:"Best for",gallery:"All photos",allExtras:"All extras and prices"},extrasTitle:"Extras and rentals",byAgreementTitle:"By agreement",termsTitle:"Good to know",bookingTitle:"Prices and booking",bookingLead:"Rent a well-equipped cottage with every comfort. The cottages also suit company meetings and recreation days. Ask for free dates by phone or email.",bookingPageTitle:"Prices and booking | Elijärven Mökkilomat, Yläne, Finland",bookingDescription:"Weekly and weekend prices, extras and booking terms for Elijärven Mökkilomat in Yläne, Finland. Book directly with the owner: +358 400 534 973, mikameri@netti.fi.",contac